  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ONTARIO QUEBEC &amp; ATLANTIC: PROTECTING WE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds under this award are to be used to acquire 3,180 acres in fee, acquire 90 acres by conservation easement, enhance 108 acres, manage 79,100 acres, and provide stewardship to 850 acres of habitat in the natural areas of Quebec, Ontario, and Atlantic regions of Canada, to benefit to migratory birds. This project will provide and enhance wintering, staging, and breeding habitat for a variety of waterfowl and wetland-dependent migratory birds.</narrative>
  </description>
